{"verb": "eat out", "audio": "audio/66 - summer/15-eat-out.mp3", "duration": 32.209, "transcript": "A new wave of small outdoor restaurants has changed how Phoenix families eat out during the hottest months. These pop-up dining spots open only after sunset and serve cold soups, salads, and ice creams under string lights. Several have shared parking lots with downtown bookstores and music venues to attract young diners. Reservations are filling up two weeks in advance. City officials say the trend is helping local food businesses survive the summer slowdown.", "words": [{"word": "A", "start": 0.1, "end": 0.14, "score": 0.94}, {"word": "new", "start": 0.2, "end": 0.381, "score": 0.759}, {"word": "wave", "start": 0.441, "end": 0.741, "score": 0.916}, {"word": "of", "start": 0.881, "end": 0.961, "score": 0.834}, {"word": "small", "start": 1.062, "end": 1.362, "score": 0.893}, {"word": "outdoor", "start": 1.482, "end": 1.843, "score": 0.822}, {"word": "restaurants", "start": 1.903, "end": 2.404, "score": 0.688}, {"word": "has", "start": 2.544, "end": 2.704, "score": 0.89}, {"word": "changed", "start": 2.824, "end": 3.185, "score": 0.789}, {"word": "how", "start": 3.265, "end": 3.445, "score": 0.917}, {"word": "Phoenix", "start": 3.505, "end": 3.866, "score": 0.711}, {"word": "families", "start": 3.906, "end": 4.307, "score": 0.753}, {"word": "eat", "start": 4.487, "end": 4.627, "score": 0.918}, {"word": "out", "start": 4.787, "end": 4.927, "score": 0.863}, {"word": "during", "start": 5.148, "end": 5.468, "score": 0.718}, {"word": "the", "start": 5.508, "end": 5.609, "score": 0.698}, {"word": "hottest", "start": 5.669, "end": 6.069, "score": 0.863}, {"word": "months.", "start": 6.169, "end": 6.49, "score": 0.82}, {"word": "These", "start": 7.531, "end": 7.752, "score": 0.668}, {"word": "pop-up", "start": 7.832, "end": 8.212, "score": 0.962}, {"word": "dining", "start": 8.273, "end": 8.613, "score": 0.83}, {"word": "spots", "start": 8.653, "end": 8.954, "score": 0.812}, {"